<title>ARMENIA: SOCCER-EARLY BABAYAN GOAL SETTLES ARMENIAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EARLY BABAYAN GOAL SETTLES ARMENIAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ararat Yerevan beat capital rivals Punic 1-0 on Wednesday to take the Armenian Cup for the fourth time in the competition's five-year history.</p>
<p>A sixth-minute strike by Sedrak Babayan settled the game in favour of Ararat, the only Armenian club to have won the Soviet championship.</p>
